11.1. A commercial bank with the permission of the Bank of Mongolia, shall conduct the  following currency transactions: 
11.1.1. non-cash foreign currency settlements; 
4 
11.1.2. buying and selling of foreign currencies in cash; 
11.1.3. opening of foreign currency accounts for permanent and temporary residents and  making transactions; and 
11.1.4. all kinds of operations involving foreign currency such as providing credit in foreign  currencies and giving guarantees.

